cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Personale: employee records, job descriptions and pay history for a personnel office (db, 2002–2004)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Personale supports the personnel office of a manufacturing company. Employee and worker records are imported from the payroll system and enriched with job description, cost centre, level, contract, category, department, education and union; the application keeps the history of levels, cost centres and pay elements (base pay, cost-of-living allowance, individual supplements, seniority increments, bonuses, severance-pay accrual) and of social-security contributions, and prints general and individual reports."
authors:
